      "comment": "GEORGIE'S WONDER (1) made a big impression on debut when made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing third (20.34) at this track over 352m. Promising type who will be in this for a long way. CHERRY BOMB (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (20.85) last time in a PM at this track. Expected to run well. MAN IN BLACK (4) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Among the leading players. GOLDSTAR HENRY (8) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
